Subject: [PATCH 6/11] phy: qcom: qmp-ufs: add SM6225 Khaje configuration

Add the SM6225 Khaje QMP UFS calibration tables and compatible match to the
upstream QMP UFS PHY driver, using the target framework instead of the vendor
ufs_qcom_phy implementation. This patch has not been compiled or hardware
validated.

---
diff --git a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-ufs.c b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-ufs.c
index ca943ce4c..7bb9243c8 100644
